# VMware publishes the vSphere Automation SDK to public PyPI under these names.
# The old `vsphere-automation-sdk` meta-package is not one of them: VMware never
# shipped it there, and the name is squatted by an unrelated 0.0.1 placeholder,
# which is why it used to be mirrored into a private registry (STAC-25544).
